        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roads never end, and the traffic never stops. Your only goal: make it across.<br><br>Grab up to 5 friends and take on 12 chaotic levels, each packed with speeding cars, tricky hazards, and hidden secrets. Time your crossings carefully and try not to get flattened, though watching a friend get launched by a car might be the funniest part. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides collectible eggs for the curious, and over 20 hats can be unlocked as you play. Survive the roads, explore the levels, and show off your style.</p>",
